---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ReferencePhoto from '../components/ReferencePhoto.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Home" description="An independent reference for the 2021 Volvo S60 third generation, covering powertrains, trims, systems, maintenance, and repairs.">
  <section class="home-hero">
    <p class="home-kicker">Independent owner's reference · 2021 model year</p>
    <h1>Volvo S60<br />2021 model year</h1>
    <p>A practical workshop-style reference for the 2021-model-year, third-generation S60 range. Browse by vehicle system, with powertrain and trim differences called out where they matter.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="vehicle-strip" aria-label="Reference coverage">
    <div><span>Generation</span><strong>Third generation (SPA platform)</strong></div>
    <div><span>Powertrains</span><strong>T5 · T6 · T8 Recharge</strong></div>
    <div><span>Configurations</span><strong>FWD · AWD · multiple trims</strong></div>
  </div>

  <section class="home-photo-section">
    <p class="home-section-label">Workshop reference / systems in view</p>
    <div class="photo-grid">
      <ReferencePhoto src="https://www.volvocars.com/media/support-content/img4b4a330b573d9c4ec0a801524b07b5d5_1_--_--_VOICEpnghigh.png" variant="reference-diagram" alt="Volvo 2021 S60 engine compartment overview with labeled service points" caption="2021 S60 engine compartment — Volvo's labeled service-point overview" credit="Volvo Cars" source="https://www.volvocars.com/uk/support/car/s60/2021/article/f3e117dc70239324c0a801513d2de23c/" license="Volvo Cars support illustration" />
      <ReferencePhoto src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/2019_Volvo_S60_T5,_front_1.26.20.jpg?width=1500" alt="Front three-quarter view of a third-generation Volvo S60" caption="Third-generation S60 exterior reference" credit="Kevauto" source="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:2019_Volvo_S60_T5,_front_1.26.20.jpg" license="CC BY-SA 4.0" />
      <ReferencePhoto src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Disc_brakes.jpg?width=1100" alt="Close-up photograph of a vehicle disc brake rotor" caption="Disc brake rotor" credit="Envy fstop" source="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Disc_brakes.jpg" license="CC BY-SA 4.0" />
    </div>
    <p class="photo-disclaimer">Representative automotive reference photographs. They are not photographs of this specific S60 and do not establish vehicle-specific fitment or procedure.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="note"><strong>Coverage and fitment.</strong> This site covers the 2021 S60 range, primarily North American specifications. Engine, drivetrain, brakes, suspension, electronics, trim, and package equipment can differ. Confirm market, VIN, build date, and installed options before ordering parts or following a repair procedure. The owner's T5 Inscription AWD is one reference example only.</div>

  <section class="home-hubs" aria-labelledby="start-here">
    <div class="home-hubs-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="home-section-label">Explore the S60</p>
        <h2 id="start-here">Where do you want to start?</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Jump straight into the parts, care schedule, model differences, or a repair topic.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="home-hub-grid">
      <a class="home-hub home-hub-featured" href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'parts/'}>
        <span class="home-hub-number">01 / IDENTIFY</span>
        <span class="home-hub-title">Parts overview</span>
        <span class="home-hub-copy">Explore the S60 by exterior, engine bay, cabin, brakes and major components.</span>
        <span class="home-hub-link">Open visual parts atlas ↗</span>
      </a>
      <a class="home-hub" href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'maintenance/'}>
        <span class="home-hub-number">02 / KEEP IT RIGHT</span>
        <span class="home-hub-title">Maintenance cycles</span>
        <span class="home-hub-copy">Service intervals, fluids, tires, inspections and maintenance records.</span>
        <span class="home-hub-link">View maintenance ↗</span>
      </a>
      <a class="home-hub" href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'repairs/'}>
        <span class="home-hub-number">03 / GET IT FIXED</span>
        <span class="home-hub-title">Repairs & DIY</span>
        <span class="home-hub-copy">Repair guides, preparation, tools, safety notes and component references.</span>
        <span class="home-hub-link">Browse repair library ↗</span>
      </a>
      <a class="home-hub" href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'introduction/specifications/'}>
        <span class="home-hub-number">04 / KNOW YOUR MODEL</span>
        <span class="home-hub-title">Trims & specifications</span>
        <span class="home-hub-copy">Compare T5, T6, T8 Recharge, Polestar Engineered, trims and drivetrains.</span>
        <span class="home-hub-link">Compare configurations ↗</span>
      </a>
      <a class="home-hub" href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'technical/'}>
        <span class="home-hub-number">05 / UNDER THE SKIN</span>
        <span class="home-hub-title">Technical systems</span>
        <span class="home-hub-copy">Engine, AWD, cooling, suspension, electrical systems and diagrams.</span>
        <span class="home-hub-link">Explore systems ↗</span>
      </a>
      <a class="home-hub" href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'troubleshooting/'}>
        <span class="home-hub-number">06 / FIND THE CAUSE</span>
        <span class="home-hub-title">Troubleshooting</span>
        <span class="home-hub-copy">Warning symbols, starting issues, AWD faults and diagnostic workflow.</span>
        <span class="home-hub-link">Diagnose an issue ↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-browse">
    <p class="home-section-label">Reference index / all sections</p>
    <nav class="home-links" aria-label="Browse all reference sections">
      <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'introduction/'}>Vehicle overview</a>
      <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'exterior/'}>Exterior, body, and paint</a>
      <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'interior/'}>Interior, seats, and controls</a>
      <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'infotainment/'}>Infotainment and displays</a>
      <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'driving/'}>Driving and vehicle operation</a>
      <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'resources/'}>Manuals and source references</a>
    </nav>
  </section>

  <h2>Using this reference</h2>
  <p>Use the search field to find a component, warning, fluid, or procedure. The navigation follows the vehicle's major systems. Pages distinguish general owner guidance from information that must be confirmed in VIN-specific factory service data.</p>
  <p>This is an independent owner-maintained project. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by Volvo Cars.</p>
</BaseLayout>
